window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><i>Ryker</i></p> <p>Now that everyone in Tempest knows a female lightning bearer exists, Ivan and my father will stop at nothing to find Ellery…<i>and I’ll do everything I can to protect her</i>. As their schemes unfold, the Revenant Woods reveals a long-buried secret with the potential to change everything.</p> <p><i>Ellery</i></p> <p>With chaos spreading through Tempest, Ryker and I aren’t prepared for the discovery hidden within the realm. Before we can unravel the mystery, an unexpected turn of events puts our lives in jeopardy. The truths we uncover could reshape our reality—but will we survive the fallout?</p> <p><b>Return to the Shadow Realms. A world where immortals unleash lightning, dark fae seduce, witches cast their spells, dragons rule the skies…and the legend of Robin Hood comes alive in a new way.</b></p> <p><i>**The Tempest Series is a spinoff of the Shadow Realms series. You do not have to listen to the Shadow Realms series to follow this one.</i></p> <p><i>Due to sexual content, violence, and language, this book is recommended for listeners 18+ years of age.</i></p>"; 
